    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.comment\n\n### Description\n\nIf I write `#` in insert mode a space should be automatically added after like `# `. Same with other comments like `// `.\n\nFor css files if I write `/*` it should expand to `/*  */` with cursor in the middle.\n\nIf I visual select a word in css and write `gciw` it should surround just that word in a comment.",
