        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> It will be very useful feature it's something that is not appropriate for this plugin? Can be enabled as option for people who always use space after comment start which can be most people.\n\nCurrently I think this is out of scope for 'mini.comment'. And in the form as stated (\"insert space after inserting left comment leader\") it is indeed to narrow. If anything, a more appropriate interface would be to have a mapping that inserts the whole comment leader as specified by 'commentstring' and puts cursor in place of `%s`. The problem is that there is no good (\"universally available\" and \"good enough to type\") mapping keys for that.\n\nOne thing where this can live is maybe in the future wiki for combos in 'mini.keymap' with \"choose your own combo\" for this.",
